- The value of cloud adoption for businesses  

Thanks to this certification, I now have the confidence and credibility to pursue entry-level cloud roles and continue advancing toward associate and professional-level AWS certifications.  

A big thank you to AWS for providing this strong foundation and helping me take the next step in my cloud career!  

